== Notes ==
*Requires [[Hordes of the Underdark]].
*This form of shapeshifting cannot be [[dispel]]led.
*At shifter level 16, unlimited uses of this ability are gained via [[infinite greater wildshape]] IV.
*The mindflayer form has the unusual property of adding a bonus to the character's intelligence and wisdom&mdash;every other shifter shape (except the [[humanoid shape|drow warrior]]'s elven [[racial modifier]] for constitution) overrides any ability score it modifies. The intelligence and wisdom bonuses are subject to the [[ability cap]].

